      "question": "Coordinates of point dividing join of A(-2, 2) and B(2, 8) in 3:1?",
      "options": {
        "A": "(1, 6.5)",
        "B": "(1, 3.5)",
        "C": "(0, 5)",
        "D": "(-1, 3.5)"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "(1, 6.5).",
      "hash": "de3a365983f7c2c0",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "बिंदुओं A(-2, 2) और B(2, 8) को जोड़ने वाले रेखाखंड को 3:1 में विभाजित करने वाले बिंदु के निर्देशांक?",
          "options": {
            "A": "(1, 6.5)",
            "B": "(1, 3.5)",
            "C": "(0, 5)",
            "D": "(-1, 3.5)"
          },
          "explanation": "x = (3(2) + 1(-2))/4 = 1, y = (3(8) + 1(2))/4 = 26/4 = 6.5। (1, 6.5)।"
        }
      }
    },
